      },
      {
        "text": "Working from home during shelter-in-place led to approximately twelve events per day.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "Many constituents are experiencing hardship and require assistance accessing unemployment benefits via the EDD.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
