    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/2/72659.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 31,
    "turn_text": "Well, the governor has has written them in automatically. So he has said, if the federal government acts, then this will be the budget. And if the federal government doesn't act, then here is another tranche of cuts that will automatically occur. And they're big cuts, 10% base reduction to funding for the University of California, 10% base reduction to the California State University. automatic 10% pay reduction for all state employees. I mean, big, big things. And some things, by the way, that shouldn't be on there. You know, while we're on the subject, one of the things they're proposing to do is to close some veterans homes, which is the last thing that I would do, you know,",
